2. In this Notification —
“approved container investment enterprise” —
(a)means an approved container investment enterprise mentioned in section 43P of the Act; and
[S 308/2024 wef 31/12/2021]
(b)includes a partnership approved by the Minister (or an authorised body) under section 43P of the Act as applied by section 36 of the Act;
[S 308/2024 wef 31/12/2021]
[S 308/2024 wef 12/04/2024]
“approved international shipping enterprise” means an approved international shipping enterprise mentioned in section 13E of the Act;
[S 308/2024 wef 31/12/2021]
“container”, “container investment enterprise” and “intermodal equipment” have the meanings given by section 43P(7) of the Act;
[S 308/2024 wef 31/12/2021]
“finance lease”, in relation to any container or intermodal equipment, means a lease of the container or intermodal equipment (including any arrangement or agreement made in connection with the lease) that has the effect of transferring substantially the obsolescence, risks or rewards incidental to ownership of the container or intermodal equipment to the lessee;
“international shipping enterprise” has the meaning given by section 13E(6) of the Act;
[S 308/2024 wef 31/12/2021]
“shipping enterprise” means any company that owns or operates one or more Singapore ships;
“Singapore ship” —
(a)means a ship in respect of which a certificate of registry has been issued under the Merchant Shipping Act 1995 and whose registry is not closed or deemed to be closed or suspended; and
[S 308/2024 wef 31/12/2021]
(b)includes a ship that is provisionally registered under the Merchant Shipping Act 1995.
[S 308/2024 wef 31/12/2021]
